title: LunchGuy
---
<<if GetGuyHasLunch()>>
    	Greg: Man oh man I sure do love me some Cowfila! 
    	Greg: Oh hey, didn't see you standing there eye balling my food... Whats up??
<<else>>
	Greg: Hey man no shoving, wait in line. 
<<endif>>

-> Pump out an essay for Opitz. <<if isTeacherDistracted() and hasActions()>>
    <<jump Essay>>
-> Pay attention. <<if not isTeacherDistracted() and hasActions()>>
    <<jump PayAttention>>
-> Cause a distraction. <<if not isTeacherDistracted() and hasActions() and GetPaper() > 0>>
    <<jump Distraction>>
-> Back
    <<stop>>
